(7413323, 1168920, 63398, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 3. For me, it''s too dark and unfocused. It also seems to be tilted. Straightened and focused would have garnered a 5 from me as I like minimalist night shots.</td>', 'I gave you a 3. For me, it''s too dark and unfocused. It also seems to be tilted. Straightened and focused would have garnered a 5 from me as I like minimalist night shots.', '2015-10-31 14:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413324, 1168687, 63398, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 4. This image has great potential as composed. Had you been in focus and worked down the highlights I would have given this a 6. It may work better with the soft focus with a B&amp;W conversion and/or some type of antique/grain overlay.</td>', 'I gave you a 4. This image has great potential as composed. Had you been in focus and worked down the highlights I would have given this a 6. It may work better with the soft focus with a B&W conversion and/or some type of antique/grain overlay.', '2015-10-31 14:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413325, 1168953, 63398, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 4. I have been here and have seen what a magnificent place this is. IMNSHO you have not managed to capture the grandeur of this fabulous place.I don''t know if you have enough resolution, but I would prolly have cropped out the rushing water and tried to get more of the building and offsetting it against that ominous sky.</td>', 'I gave this a 4. I have been here and have seen what a magnificent place this is. IMNSHO you have not managed to capture the grandeur of this fabulous place.I don''t know if you have enough resolution, but I would prolly have cropped out the rushing water and tried to get more of the building and offsetting it against that ominous sky.', '2015-10-31 14:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7413326, 1168897, 63398, '<td valign="top">Very cool subject. The location of the tree trunk right behind the barrel really makes me twitch.</td>', 'Very cool subject. The location of the tree trunk right behind the barrel really makes me twitch.', '2015-10-31 14:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
