(7414553, 1168878, 60495, '<td valign="top">In Estes Park you can''t get much more historic than The Stanley hotel, nice shot Richard, I took a few early morning shots as I went by the other day but I did not find one I liked enough to enter. As a kid I remember my Grandmother would go there all the time to get her hair done at the beauty salon and we would ride along to drop her off and pick her up, such a cool old place.</td>', 'In Estes Park you can''t get much more historic than The Stanley hotel, nice shot Richard, I took a few early morning shots as I went by the other day but I did not find one I liked enough to enter. As a kid I remember my Grandmother would go there all the time to get her hair done at the beauty salon and we would ride along to drop her off and pick her up, such a cool old place.', '2015-11-06 09:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
